            "title": "Huron (HURN) Q3 2025 Earnings Call Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "With me today are John Kelly, our Chief Financial Officer, and Ronnie Dale, our Chief Operating Officer.  Company-wide revenues before reimbursable expenses, or RBR, grew 17% in the third quarter, including 10% organic growth, reflecting a robust demand environment for our services and strong execution by our teams.  The combination of our deep industry expertise and breadth of capabilities has positioned us as a partner of choice for our clients as they continue to face persistent financial challenges and regulatory disruption.",
